# 換行一律 LF（Windows 取出也是 LF）：部署是把檔案複製到 Linux 伺服器，換行一致才不會干擾部署前的 md5 比對
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批次檔需要 CRLF（目前沒有，預先設好）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二進位檔：不轉換、不做文字 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.pdf binary
